---
layout: layouts/base.njk
caseStudy: true
pageId: work
---
{#
  CASE STUDY LAYOUT — the shell every project write-up renders into.

  Wraps base.njk, so a case study inherits <head>, nav and scripts and only
  declares what is specific to it. Front matter a case study must set:

    title        page + OG title
    description  meta description
    project      slug matching an entry in _data/projects.js — the header,
                 the prev/next links and the JSON-LD all read from that entry
                 rather than repeating client/year/role in front matter

  THE READING-PROGRESS BAR HAS NO DRIVER. scripts/progress.js was deleted in
  the cleanup sweep; it had never driven this element in the first place, since
  it queried `.scroll-progress` while this markup renders `.progress-bar`, and
  no template ever loaded it. The bar therefore paints at 0% and stays there.
  Left in place rather than removed because the fix is a few lines of JS and
  belongs with the case-study redesign, not with a deletion sweep.
#}

{% from "components/button.njk" import button %}
{% from "components/link.njk" import link %}

{%- set current = null -%}
{%- for p in collections.projects -%}
  {%- if p.slug == project %}{% set current = p %}{% endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}

<div class="progress-bar" data-progress aria-hidden="true"><span class="progress-bar-fill"></span></div>

<article class="case-study">
  <header class="case-header">
    {{ link("← All projects", href="/projects/", class="case-back") }}
    <h1 class="case-title">{{ title }}</h1>
    {%- if current %}
      <dl class="case-meta">
        <div><dt>Client</dt><dd>{{ current.title }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Role</dt><dd>{{ current.role }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Year</dt><dd>{{ current.year }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Domain</dt><dd>{{ current.domain }}</dd></div>
      </dl>
    {%- endif %}
  </header>

  <div class="case-body">
    {{ content | safe }}
  </div>

  <footer class="case-footer">
    {{ button(label="View All Projects", href="/projects/", iconName="chevron-down", rotate=-90) }}
  </footer>
</article>

{% include "partials/footer.njk" %}
